Bundled fraud datasets. Generated 2026-10-08 by server/internal/fraud/gen (run by hand: cd server/internal/fraud && go run ./gen).

hosting4.bin, hosting6.bin
  Source:  ipverse as-ip-blocks, https://github.com/ipverse/as-ip-blocks
           (release archive as-ip-blocks.tar.gz, ASNs with metadata.category "hosting")
  License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
  Changes: ASNs whose org is Akamai, Cloudflare or Fastly dropped (Linode kept);
           prefixes merged into sorted, non-overlapping intervals;
           Apple iCloud Private Relay egress ranges subtracted.
  Format:  big-endian lo,hi address pairs, 8 bytes (v4) / 32 bytes (v6) per interval.

  Apple iCloud Private Relay egress list, https://mask-api.icloud.com/egress-ip-ranges.csv
  Used only at generation time to subtract ranges. Not redistributed.

bots.txt
  Source:  PostHog bot definitions, livestream/bot/definitions.json
           https://github.com/PostHog/posthog (outside ee/, MIT Expat)
  Changes: "pattern" field only, deduplicated case-insensitively.

